      "releaseNotes": "Your money check-in is now a little cleaner and more precise.\n\nPlanned transactions logged early now stay on their intended dates, keeping upcoming activity clearer and easier to follow.\n\nBudget filtering has also been improved so totals align more accurately with the transactions included in each period.\n\nInsights, contribution momentum, collection layouts, and interest earnings have also been refined for a cleaner, more consistent experience.",
