      "description": "Richual is a personal wallet, budget, goals, and money insights app designed to make everyday money tracking feel clear, calm, and actually doable.\n\nTrack your wallets, savings, credit cards, cash, debts, budgets, goals, recurring transactions, interest earnings, and money habits in one beautifully organized space.\n\nRichual is built for people who want more than a plain expense tracker. It helps you understand your money picture, follow simple budgets, fund meaningful goals, and spot the patterns behind your spending.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\nWALLETS IN ONE PLACE\nTrack cash, banks, e-wallets, savings, credit cards, debts, and other accounts without clutter.\n\nBUDGETS, WITHOUT THE CLUTTER\nCreate simple category budgets and see where your month is headed before it gets messy.\n\nGOALS THAT FEEL CLOSER\nSave for emergency funds, trips, gadgets, career moves, or anything future you is building toward.\n\nMONEY INSIGHTS\nSee spending patterns, wallet distribution, cash flow, category breakdowns, and money trends in a visual way.\n\nRECURRING TRANSACTIONS\nTrack repeating bills, subscriptions, transfers, and regular income so the usuals stay handled.\n\nINTEREST EARNINGS TRACKING\nTrack interest from savings or digital bank accounts and see quiet money do its thing.\n\nMULTI-CURRENCY READY\nManage wallets across different currencies and keep your bigger money picture clear.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nRichual is designed around privacy, offline access, and Apple-device sync. Your data stays with you.\n\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR WHOLE VIBE\nPersonalize cards, wallets, colors, themes, and your money space so the app feels like yours.\n\nBEAUTIFULLY DESIGNED\nA finance tracker that feels clean, polished, and easy to come back to.\n\nNO ADS. EVER.\nNo interruptions. No noisy banners. Just your money, your space, your ritual.\n\nRichual is not a bank, broker, lender, or trading platform. It does not connect to bank accounts or process financial transactions. It is a manual personal finance tracker made to help you organize, understand, and build better money habits.\n\nMake wealth a daily ritual.\n\nTerms of Use: https://richual-app.vercel.app/terms.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://richual-app.vercel.app/privacy.html",
